Package: APCinteractionData
Type: Package
Title: Pre-Computed Null Distributions for 'APCinteraction'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bao Khue", "Tran", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "baokhuetran@outlook.com"),
    person("Andrew", "Nguyen", role = c("aut", "ctb")),
    person("Amy", "Wagaman", role = "ctb"),
    person("Bradley", "Hartlaub", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides pre-computed null distributions (100,000 simulations each)
    for the APCSSA and APCSSM nonparametric interaction test statistics
    implemented in the 'APCinteraction' package. Covers two-way ANOVA designs
    with 2 to 6 factor levels and 1 to 10 replications. Install this package
    to enable fast p-value estimation without running simulations.
